# Arrow Flow: Privacy Policy

**Last updated:** 22 October 2026
**App:** Arrow Flow: Arrow Puzzle Game (`com.bosscodes.arrowflow`)
**Developer:** BossCodes
**Contact:** hassamarain797@gmail.com

Arrow Flow is a puzzle game for Android. This policy explains, in plain words, what the
app does with your information. The short version: **Arrow Flow does not collect your
personal information.**

## 1. What we collect

We do not collect, store on a server, share or sell any personal information. The app
has no account or sign-in, no advertising, no analytics and no tracking. We do not ask
for your name, e-mail address, phone number, contacts, photos, microphone, camera or
location, and the app does not request any permission to read them.

## 2. What stays on your phone

To let you carry on where you stopped, the game saves on your device only: your progress
(levels completed, stars, best times), your streak and records, the golden arrows and
worlds you unlocked, your hints and hearts, and your settings (sound, music, vibration,
dark mode, colours). This data never leaves your phone. It is deleted when you uninstall
the app or clear its storage in Android settings.

## 3. Internet

The game works fully offline. The app itself does not connect to any server of ours and
does not send any data anywhere.

## 4. Google Play

If you installed Arrow Flow from Google Play, Google may tell the app that a newer version
is available (the "update available" box) through Google Play's own update service. This
is done by Google Play on your phone, under Google's own privacy policy
(https://policies.google.com/privacy). Google Play may also give us anonymous crash and
performance reports (Android vitals) if you chose to share diagnostics with Google; they
contain no personal information about you and we use them only to fix problems.

## 5. Third-party code and content

The game uses open-source libraries (Flutter, Flame, audioplayers and others) that run
inside the app and do not send your data anywhere. The pictures and music in the game are
used under their free licenses; see the credits in the app description and the project
page.

## 6. Children

Arrow Flow has no ads, no purchases, no chat and no way to contact other people, and it
collects nothing, so it is safe for all ages. We do not knowingly collect information from
anyone, including children.

## 7. Your choices and rights

Because we hold no personal information about you, there is nothing for us to access,
correct or delete on our side. You can remove everything the game saved on your phone at
any time by clearing the app's storage or uninstalling it.

## 8. Security

Your game data is stored in the app's private storage on your phone, which other apps
cannot read. Nothing is transmitted, so there is nothing to intercept.

## 9. Changes to this policy

If this policy changes (for example when a new feature is added), the new version will be
published at the same address with a new "Last updated" date, and the app description will
mention anything that affects your data.

